      "description": "Serial number: AV26-423 Date: May 5, 2026 Updated: October 19, 2026 On May 5, 2026, Redis published a security advisory to address vulnerabilities in the following products: Redis Software \u2013 multiple versions Redis OSS/CE releases \u2013 multiple versions Update 1 Open-source reporting indicates that CVE-2026-25243 is being exploited in the wild. The Cyber Centre encourages users and administrators to review the provided web links and apply the necessary updates. Redis Security advisory: [CVE\u20112026\u201123479] [CVE\u20112026\u201125243] [CVE-2026-25588] [CVE\u20112026\u201125589] [CVE-2026-23631] Redis Security Advisories",
